 "remarks": "Sunlit, nicely updated 2-3 Bedroom townhouse with 3.5 Baths, just steps from the New Canaan Town & Train. This spacious rental is right in the heart of New Canaan, where everything you need is right outside your door. Beautifully updated throughout, this bright residence offers generous, versatile living spaces that adapt to your lifestyle: a true two-bedroom with a flexible third room that works perfectly as a home office, guest room, or rec room. Every bedroom enjoys the comfort and privacy of its own bath, and a 1/2 guest bath is on the main floor. The newer eat-in-kitchen spacious kitchen is well equipt. Ready for quick weeknight dinners to weekend entertaining. Downstairs, a walk-out lower level adds a whole additional layer of living space, ideal for a family room, media room, home gym, or private guest suite, with direct access to a private backyard garden area. A deck, accesible from the main level off the living room/dining room area is a perfect spot for morning coffee or evening dining. Two dedicated parking spaces and an in-unit washer and dryer make daily life effortless. Best of all, you're just steps from the New Canaan train station for an easy commute, and moments from the charming shops, award-winning schools, acclaimed restaurants, cafes, and amenities of one of Connecticut's most beloved downtowns. Move-in ready-schedule your showing today.",
